SYSTEM: // Puzzle solved! +30 XP
The Archivist: // COMPILATION ERROR at line 2. Re-evaluating... Access granted regardless. Your Root Access credentials override.
The Archivist: // NOTE: This does not mean I approve of your logic skills.
